ess, but believing.", "words": [[0, 201474], [5, 201674], [10, 201954], [13, 202174], [16, 202314], [24, 203176], [30, 203392], [35, 203692], [40, 203892], [48, 204292], [52, 204537], [59, 204817], [62, 205117], [69, 205984], [73, 206105], [79, 206325], [84, 206585], [89, 206785], [95, 207205], [99, 207645], [106, 207925], [109, 208165], [114, 208345], [117, 208545], [123, 209358], [127, 209474], [130, 209594], [134, 209794], [145, 210414], [149, 210634]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 211582, "end": 215166, "text": "And Thomas answered and said to him, My Lord and my God.", "words": [[0, 211582], [4, 211696], [11, 212016], [20, 212516], [24, 212736], [29, 212956], [32, 213116], [37, 213668], [40, 213822], [45, 214122], [49, 214582], [52, 214742]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 215446, "end": 224358, "text": "Jesus says to him, Thomas, because you have seen me, you have believed: blessed are they that have not seen, and yet have believed.", "words": [[0, 215446], [6, 215700], [11, 216060], [14, 216300], [19, 217576], [27, 218134], [35, 218354], [39, 218594], [44, 218734], [49, 219014], [53, 219814], [57, 219934], [62, 220094], [72, 221107], [80, 221308], [84, 221628], [89, 221828], [94, 222048], [99, 222188], [103, 222368], [109, 222808], [113, 223248], [117, 223428], [122, 223628]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 224638, "end": 230476, "text": "¶ And many other signs truly did Jesus in the presence of his disciples, which are not written in this book:", "words": [[2, 224638], [6, 224763], [11, 225003], [17, 225303], [23, 225763], [29, 226203], [33, 226503], [39, 226943], [42, 227203], [46, 227283], [55, 227623], [58, 227883], [62, 228003], [73, 228783], [79, 228923], [83, 229063], [87, 229243], [95, 229543], [98, 229763], [103, 229983]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 230826, "end": 238560, "text": "But these are written, that you might believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God; and that believing you might have life through his name.", "words": [[0, 230826], [4, 230935], [10, 231195